  "title": "Leeward Caravan",
  "rules": [
    "Any two travelers can grip the opposite north/south load handles; there are no permanently assigned specialist roles.",
    "A matching directional command translates the whole load-and-carrier body only if all target cells are free and both carriers can pay.",
    "The windbreak casts a three-cell downwind shadow with lateral width one cell on each side.",
    "Unattached movement costs one energy; hauling costs two. Exposure adds two, and moving against wind adds one.",
    "Windbreak shifts happen before cost calculation and consume two energy from one adjacent unattached traveler.",
    "Resting in shade restores two energy. Drinking spends one water to restore up to four energy.",
    "Water gifts and well draws transfer real finite units. Wells do not refill.",
    "Wind rotates east, south, west and north in eight-tick blocks. The ridge permits alternative upper and lower routes.",
    "Arrival ends naturally; otherwise the horizon is 128."
  ],
